    description="Open source project for transparent dynamic finance research."
>

    <p class="tagline">Open source project for transparent dynamic finance research.</p>

    <p>
        There exists important economic and financial research. It is often accessible, but not legible even to the motivated general audience.
    </p>

    <p>
        Paralx slowly explains models without assumed knowledge, shows derivations and proofs, explores counterarguments, addresses prerequisites, and pulls live data so that every model is replicable and up-to-date. It is free and open source.
    </p>

    <p>Our <a href="/models/keynesian-cross">first model</a> is currently in progress.</p>
</Default>

